WEBVTT

00:04:28.538 --> 00:04:33.538
That's such an interesting question,
I don't know is my first thought,

00:04:34.204 --> 00:04:38.746
my second thought is it reminds
me of some research that

00:04:38.746 --> 00:04:42.496
I loved by sociologists that started
in the 70s. They did.

00:04:42.496 --> 00:04:44.621
This study is where they
were interested in

00:04:44.621 --> 00:04:47.704
the effects of being micromanaged at work

00:04:48.163 --> 00:04:50.579
and not just how we thought
about our jobs,

00:04:50.579 --> 00:04:53.454
but how we behaved in the
rest of our lives.

00:04:53.454 --> 00:04:56.079
And they found that if you had
a really controlling boss,

00:04:56.579 --> 00:04:59.329
that you actually became
more authoritarian as

00:04:59.329 --> 00:05:00.538
a parent with your children,